# Third-party notices: esclop-engine

`esclop-engine` (GPL-3.0-or-later) links the Rust crates below. This file is generated by
`cargo about` from `engine/Cargo.lock`; regenerate it with `Scripts/build-engine.sh --notices`
whenever dependencies change. Programs the app runs as separate processes (ffmpeg,
gifsicle) are listed in `THIRD_PARTY.md`.

Because gifski (AGPL-3.0-or-later) is part of the engine, the combined engine binary is also
subject to the AGPL's network clause: if it is ever offered to remote users (for example
through an MCP server over HTTP), those users must be offered its source.

